# Mobile Manager & Troubleshooter

A comprehensive cross-platform mobile device management and troubleshooting application. Users can download the native app, and view detailed device analytics, diagnostics, and solutions on a web dashboard.

## Features

### Mobile App (Android & iOS)
- **Performance Monitoring**: Real-time RAM, CPU, battery, and storage tracking
- **App Management**: Analyze app permissions, storage usage, and battery consumption
- **System Diagnostics**: Check device health, temperature, and connectivity
- **Security Scan**: Detect potential threats and malware
- **Battery Optimization**: Identify power-consuming apps and processes
- **Storage Cleanup**: Find and remove unnecessary files
- **Network Analysis**: WiFi and cellular connection diagnostics
- **Device Info**: Complete hardware and software details
- **Auto-Sync**: Send data to cloud for web dashboard viewing

### Web Dashboard
- View all connected devices
- Real-time device statistics and health status
- Historical performance data and charts
- Troubleshooting recommendations
- Device settings and remote management
- Export reports and analytics
- User account management

### Backend API
- RESTful API for mobile apps
- User authentication and authorization
- Device data storage and processing
- Advanced analytics
- Notification system

